title: Site map › Every menu tab and sub tab
route: / (opens the Dashboard)
intro: The whole product on one page. Each green screen is a sidebar destination; dashed boxes jump to the diagrams for that tab. The top bar (site switcher, Ask FLO, Notifications, Demo menu) is on every page. Authorizations is the only item with sub items (All Authorizations, New Case, Eligibility & Benefits), and its arrow opens and closes them. There is no Case Manager tab: its tracker and its reviews are views of the one Authorizations worklist.
dir: LR
also: Old Case Manager links (/manager, /active) open the matching Authorizations view, see Global shell › Addresses.
---
start s0 "Open Psyflo\nThe address / goes to the Dashboard"
screen shell "App frame\nSidebar on the left, top bar on top, page in the middle"

group gTop "Top bar (on every page)"
  overlay ask "Ask FLO\nDrawer: ask a question, answers from your data"
  overlay notif "Notifications\nList of what needs you"
  overlay site "Site switcher\nBoth sites, Site A, Site B (a locked 'Site A only' or 'Site B only' for one-site staff)"
  overlay demo "Demo menu\nReset data, move the clock, Viewing as (four people), suggested path"
endgroup

group gMain "Sidebar › Main"
  screen dash "Dashboard\nLifecycle chips, Do next, authorizations table"
  screen auth "Authorizations › All Authorizations\nOne worklist with view chips: All, Needs attention, In progress, With the payer, Approved, Denied, Reviews this week"
  screen newc "Authorizations › New Case\nIntake, Eligibility & Benefits, Clinical documentation, Authorization preparation, Review & submit"
  screen elig "Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits\nList, verify a patient, result"
  screen den "Denial Intelligence\nOpen denials, options, brief"
  screen ana "Analytics\nPerformance and the monthly report"
endgroup

group gConn "Sidebar › Connections"
  screen emr "EMR Connect\nSystems per site, sync, mappings"
  screen pay "Payers\nLanding list, then one payer with four views"
endgroup

group gBot "Sidebar › Bottom"
  screen set "Settings\nThe sixteen agents, Pause all and Sites and access"
  toast help "Help\nA toast points to Ask FLO and the Demo menu"
  toast out "Sign out\nA toast: there is nothing to sign out of"
endgroup

group gSub "Pages reached from inside a tab"
  screen case "Authorizations › Case page\nThree tabs: Recommended actions, Clinical picture & draft, Criteria & risk"
  screen ledg "Authorizations › Approved authorization with no open request\nCase summary, window, units, reviews due, history"
  overlay rev "Authorizations › Reviews this week › Review drawer\nOpens from a row in Reviews this week"
  screen ref "New Case › Full referral page\nExtracted, Validation, Coverage, Fit, Activity"
  screen ver "Eligibility › Verify a patient and Result"
  screen brief "Denial Intelligence › Peer-to-peer brief"
  screen rep "Denial Intelligence › Appeal analysis report\nFor every denial, copy or download as PDF"
  screen payer "Payers › One payer\nWorkflow Builder, Rules & Instructions, Test Workflow, History & Changes tabs"
endgroup

goto g0 "Continues in: Who can see what › Roles, sites and a record at the other site"
goto g1 "Continues in: Global shell"
goto g2 "Continues in: Dashboard"
goto g3 "Continues in: Authorizations › Worklist › Arrive and read the views"
goto g3b "Continues in: Case Manager › Ledger case › Open and read"
goto g3c "Continues in: Case Manager › Reviews this week › The review drawer"
goto g4 "Continues in: Authorizations › New Case"
goto g5 "Continues in: Authorizations › Eligibility & Benefits"
goto g6 "Continues in: Denial Intelligence"
goto g8 "Continues in: Analytics"
goto g9 "Continues in: EMR Connect"
goto g10 "Continues in: Payers"
goto g11 "Continues in: Settings"

s0 --> shell
shell --> ask & notif & demo & site
site --> g0
demo --> g0
shell --> dash & auth & newc & elig & den & ana
shell --> emr & pay
shell --> set & help & out
auth --> case & ledg & rev
ledg --> g3b
rev --> g3c
newc --> ref
elig --> ver
den --> brief & rep
pay --> payer
ask --> g1
dash --> g2
auth --> g3
newc --> g4
elig --> g5
den --> g6
ana --> g8
emr --> g9
pay --> g10
set --> g11
